        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "In addition to exploring the variation of chain lengths m, n, and p on the properties of the regioregular alternating polymers, we also prepared the regiorandom analogue, Rn(Th-5,4/8), by the oxidative polymerization<sup>64,76,77</sup> of $\\mathbf { 6 } ( m = 5 , n =$$4 , p = 8 )$in chloroform with ferric chloride."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      },
      "polymer_type": null,
      "copolymer_type": null,
      "material_type": null
    },
    {
