        "bbox": [
          514.0,
          51.0,
          932.0,
          240.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "For instance, the chloroform-soluble portion of Rg(Th-5,4/12) (x ) 69) exhibits a melting point $( T _ { \\mathrm { m } } )$at $1 9 7 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$on heating and a crystallization temperature $( T _ { \\mathrm { c } } )$at 169 °C on cooling"
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      },
      "copolymer_type": null,
      "material_type": null
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "s003",
      "sample_kind": "synthesis_batch",
      "refers_to_entity": "pe007",
      "polymer_name": "Rg(Th-5,4/8)",
      "polymer_type": "homopolymer",
      "sample_label_raw": "Rg(Th-5,4/8)",
      "intended_use": [],
      "evidence": {
        "block_id": "P_3_47",
        "page": 3,
        "bbox": [
          66.0,
          853.0,
          483.0,
          964.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "In the region of 125-145 ppm, the regioregular analogue Rg(Th-5,4/8) reveals four pairs of sharp, closely spaced peaks which are assigned to the eight carbon atoms of the two dissimilarly substituted thiophene rings of the repeat unit."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      },
      "copolymer_type": null,
      "material_type": null
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "s004",
      "sample_kind": "synthesis_batch",
      "refers_to_entity": "pe008",
      "polymer_name": "Rg(Th-5,4/4)",
      "polymer_type": "homopolymer",
      "sample_label_raw": "Rg(Th-5,4/4)",
      "intended_use": [],
      "evidence": {
